 n\n  - Probate\n  - The Probate Court is responsible for the settlement of
  estates. Estates are settled through the administration of wills and trus
 ts and provide for the orderly disposition of assets to the appropriate re
 cipients in a timely and effective manner.\n  - The Probate Court is also 
